  kind: 0
  title: T568A and T568B
  body: '- T568B: white-orange, orange, white-green, blue, white-blue, green, white-brown,
    brown.

    - T568A swaps the orange and green pairs.

    - Straight-through:
    same standard both ends. Crossover: A at one end, B at the other.

    - Untwist
    no more than 13 mm and push every wire to the end of the plug.'
